model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "Acceptance journeys intercept the public app-account creation request and retain its creation identity across a lost response. Query holds precede refresh and prove failure and retry, and loading assertions wait for an observable loading state. Display, menu and tool expectations follow their declared contracts. Only the controlled PostgreSQL startup-failure fixture normalizes ECONNRESET. Managed MCP signing keys cross the private redacted fixture channel, never run metadata or exported evidence. Existing authority, persistence, recovery assertions and deadlines remain intact."
    }
  }
}
